   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RAF: NAM Final PDC event, June 2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The strategy period to phase-out bilateral development cooperation between Sweden, BW, NAM &amp; SA formally ended on 31 Dec 2013. During the 1st half of 2014, a series of celebratory activities/events are planned in the 3 countries, which also serve to communicate the results of the long-standing development cooperation. The PDC event in Namibia takes place during week 24.</narrative>
